pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# Stationary wall-time control for the HFR map/pause gate. Event times match
# the unlocked script exactly; only the renderer launch settings differ.
# clock-hz 60
# expect-performance 50000 20 20 70
# expect-simulation-time 0.95 1.08 2
# expect-image free-roam 20 35 1.00
# expect-image map 4 12 0.15
# expect-image map-return 30 50 1.00
# expect-image pause 25 40 1.00
# expect-image resumed 35 55 1.00
# expect-capture-mae map free-roam 20
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 732 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 960 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 972 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1200 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1212 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1440 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1452 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1560 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1800 free-roam
input 1860 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1920 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1932 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2100 map
input 2280 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2292 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2480 map-return
input 2580 0010 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2592 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2760 pause
input 2880 2000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2892 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 3120 resumed
stop 3180
